WEBVTT

01:18.300 --> 01:19.551
So...

01:19.551 --> 01:21.498
Care for a cup of coffee?

01:21.498 --> 01:22.958
I'm good, it's late.

01:22.958 --> 01:25.206
Then at least have some cold water.

01:25.206 --> 01:27.223
You must be wiped out.

01:33.384 --> 01:36.091
He's not exactly a feather.

01:36.091 --> 01:38.838
You're stronger than you look.

01:38.838 --> 01:40.720
I just roll with whatever comes.

01:40.720 --> 01:42.555
Thanks for the water.

01:46.828 --> 01:49.977
Ki Jun and I share a place.

01:51.509 --> 01:53.010
I figured.

01:53.010 --> 01:54.191
Don't read into it.

01:54.191 --> 01:57.237
I'm just crashing here for a bit
because of some stuff going on.

01:57.237 --> 02:00.448
Ki Jun's only a friend to me.

02:00.448 --> 02:02.763
For now, anyway.

02:02.763 --> 02:05.553
We dated briefly way back.

02:06.567 --> 02:08.284
Got it.

02:10.342 --> 02:11.584
Thanks for the water.

02:11.584 --> 02:13.602
Sorry for stopping by so late.

02:38.236 --> 02:40.357
Joo In Ah, what are you doing?

02:40.947 --> 02:42.882
Snap out of it.

02:48.454 --> 02:51.831
[Episode 6: Is it off the table?]

02:53.342 --> 02:54.919
Noh Ki Jun, get up.

02:54.919 --> 02:57.255
Be ready in ten and I'll put you in a cab.

02:57.255 --> 03:00.216
My head's killing me.

03:00.216 --> 03:02.759
How did I even get home last night?

03:02.759 --> 03:04.570
You just...

03:05.925 --> 03:08.041
walked in nice and easy.

03:08.725 --> 03:11.811
That homing instinct never fails.

03:11.811 --> 03:13.145
Nailed it.

03:13.145 --> 03:14.872
Good job.

03:18.276 --> 03:20.006
Drop me off up there.

03:20.006 --> 03:21.545
You take it the rest of the way.

03:21.545 --> 03:23.305
It's fine.

03:23.305 --> 03:25.633
Just ride up to the office with me.

03:26.305 --> 03:27.545
What's the occasion?

03:27.545 --> 03:29.245
Hey, no complaints from me.

03:29.245 --> 03:31.263
Okay.

03:39.881 --> 03:41.674
Ms. Joo.

03:41.674 --> 03:43.442
Morning.

03:44.239 --> 03:45.986
Morning.

03:50.467 --> 03:52.743
Did you make it home okay last night?

03:53.399 --> 03:56.831
We had a team dinner thing going on.

03:59.300 --> 04:02.362
Thanks to you, I made it home fine.

04:02.362 --> 04:05.131
- How are you...
- Ki Jun.

04:11.955 --> 04:13.264
What's this about?

04:13.264 --> 04:16.350
Acting all sloppy in front of your boss.

04:16.964 --> 04:19.145
Don't you think, Ms. Joo?

04:20.412 --> 04:21.525
Hard to say.

04:21.525 --> 04:23.691
Sloppy is pretty much his default with me.

04:31.384 --> 04:33.200
What's wrong with you?

04:40.248 --> 04:41.939
What's gotten into Secretary Park?

04:41.939 --> 04:43.618
Did she eat something weird?

04:43.618 --> 04:46.364
You heard about Manager Do over at Cosmetics,
right?

04:46.364 --> 04:47.407
Yes.

04:47.407 --> 04:49.739
I'm tacking on assault and bodily harm
to the PM violation

04:49.739 --> 04:51.378
and revisiting the disciplinary level.

04:51.378 --> 04:54.104
On top of that,
several clients are calling out his behavior

04:54.104 --> 04:55.290
and pulling their contracts.

04:55.290 --> 04:56.750
We're talking serious numbers.

04:56.750 --> 04:59.258
Loop in Legal and start looking at termination.

04:59.258 --> 05:01.421
Yes, will do.

05:01.421 --> 05:04.318
By the way, are you feeling all right?

05:04.318 --> 05:06.458
Shouldn't you rest a little?

05:06.458 --> 05:07.979
- Maybe take a half-day...
- I'm fine.

05:07.979 --> 05:09.278
I said I'm fine.

05:09.278 --> 05:11.193
You think I'd be the youngest female executive

05:11.193 --> 05:14.398
if I burned a half-day
every time I had a few drinks?

05:14.398 --> 05:16.061
I'm Joo In Ah.

05:16.061 --> 05:18.579
A little thing like this

05:23.902 --> 05:26.272
never throws me off, ever.

05:27.113 --> 05:28.756
Right.

05:30.825 --> 05:32.676
That earns my respect.

05:52.883 --> 05:56.351
Yes, looking great.

05:56.351 --> 05:58.676
Last one.

05:58.676 --> 06:00.843
That's a wrap.

06:00.843 --> 06:02.607
You're working so hard.

06:02.607 --> 06:04.901
The shots are coming out really sharp.

06:04.901 --> 06:05.938
What time?

06:05.938 --> 06:07.911
Oh, just past nine.

06:07.911 --> 06:09.463
What?

06:11.370 --> 06:13.426
- I'm leaving.
- Hey, where are you going?

06:13.426 --> 06:15.131
Wrap it up yourself, my girl's waiting.

06:15.131 --> 06:17.231
There's still a few setups to go.

06:17.231 --> 06:18.330
PK.

06:18.330 --> 06:20.474
Where are you going?

06:42.925 --> 06:44.183
What should we do later?

06:44.183 --> 06:46.363
What do you feel like?

06:46.363 --> 06:48.403
Just stay still for now.

06:48.403 --> 06:52.073
Hold on, I'm driving.

06:59.676 --> 07:01.243
- One second.
- What?

07:01.243 --> 07:02.750
We've got time, just a second.

07:02.750 --> 07:03.764
Kiss me.

07:03.764 --> 07:06.684
- I'm driving.
- You stopped.

07:06.684 --> 07:08.144
- I'll give you plenty later.
- No.

07:08.144 --> 07:08.904
- Stay still.
- Hang on.

07:08.904 --> 07:11.108
Just a second, seriously.

07:14.592 --> 07:16.405
What the hell?

07:20.134 --> 07:21.426
What was that?

07:21.426 --> 07:23.579
You're dead.

07:28.134 --> 07:29.444
Step on it.

07:29.444 --> 07:31.800
He's getting away.

07:31.800 --> 07:33.300
He's not stopping.

07:33.300 --> 07:35.549
This is so much fun.

07:59.328 --> 08:00.669
You're not going to pull over?

08:00.669 --> 08:02.529
How dare you take a photo of...

08:02.529 --> 08:04.828
I said pull over!

08:12.676 --> 08:13.946
Damn it.

08:13.946 --> 08:16.676
Oh, come on.

08:16.676 --> 08:18.759
- What the heck?
- What is it?

08:21.217 --> 08:23.305
This is unbelievable.

08:24.134 --> 08:25.333
Is he okay?

08:25.333 --> 08:27.467
Get out of the car.

08:27.467 --> 08:29.686
Damn it, seriously.

08:30.299 --> 08:32.590
Singer slash actor and top star PK

08:32.590 --> 08:35.301
[Top Star PK, Late-Night Chase]
got into a wreck downtown last night,

08:35.301 --> 08:36.969
and the backlash is huge.

08:36.969 --> 08:39.175
Investigations show it was not a simple mishap.

08:39.175 --> 08:41.132
[Brands Cut Ties with PK, Massive Penalty Fees]
He intentionally went after the other vehicle

08:41.132 --> 08:42.759
and hit it,

08:42.759 --> 08:45.227
["PK's Midnight Pursuit"]
which is making the whole thing way worse.

08:45.227 --> 08:47.384
Just the breach fees from advertisers alone

08:47.384 --> 08:50.483
[PK Stays Quiet on Road Rage]
could reach into the tens of millions,

08:50.483 --> 08:53.627
and the entire industry is buzzing over it.

08:54.487 --> 08:55.759
Seriously.

08:55.759 --> 08:57.823
PK...

08:57.823 --> 08:59.968
What were you thinking?

08:59.968 --> 09:02.636
With a face like this?

09:05.957 --> 09:07.349
Are you a PK fan?

09:07.349 --> 09:09.509
Yes, she's a die-hard fan.

09:09.509 --> 09:13.388
Anytime PK was on a flyer, I'd snag it for her.

09:17.050 --> 09:19.945
So he's done as our spokesmodel, right?

09:23.800 --> 09:25.549
Sir.

09:25.549 --> 09:28.192
Let me go get some sugar in me,

09:28.192 --> 09:29.800
since I can't bring myself to work.

09:29.800 --> 09:33.417
Yeah, go on. Take a breather and reset.

09:38.967 --> 09:42.243
What's a grown adult doing fawning over celebs?

09:42.243 --> 09:43.612
Don't you think, Da Ye?

09:43.612 --> 09:45.373
I guess people get like that.

09:45.373 --> 09:47.613
You don't have any celebrity crushes?

09:47.613 --> 09:51.002
Please, Da Ye doesn't bother with that stuff.

09:51.002 --> 09:52.468
You think she got into SNU for free?

09:52.468 --> 09:53.753
The CPA exam doesn't pass itself.

09:53.753 --> 09:56.132
- True.
- She just buckled down and studied.

09:56.132 --> 09:57.532
Never got distracted.

09:57.532 --> 09:59.300
Right?

09:59.300 --> 10:00.355
Look at her.

10:00.355 --> 10:02.592
We're talking about her,
and she's tuning us out,

10:02.592 --> 10:04.558
just locked in on her work.

10:04.558 --> 10:05.736
That's a future big shot.

10:05.736 --> 10:07.534
Honestly, I'm jealous.

10:15.693 --> 10:17.904
[A new message has arrived from
Assistant Manager Shin Ji Hye in Marketing]

10:20.342 --> 10:23.133
Got a second, Ki Jun?

10:25.077 --> 10:26.830
The invitation came out nice.

10:26.830 --> 10:28.575
Congrats on the wedding.

10:28.575 --> 10:30.870
Means a lot.

10:30.870 --> 10:33.800
Hey, listen.

10:33.800 --> 10:36.313
I owe you an apology.

10:36.923 --> 10:41.177
Remember the stairwell,

10:41.177 --> 10:43.654
when I jumped you?

10:45.807 --> 10:48.310
Marriage blues, like you said.

10:48.310 --> 10:51.397
I'm a whole new person now.

10:51.397 --> 10:53.134
I'll give my husband everything I've got.

10:53.134 --> 10:55.191
Smart call.

10:55.191 --> 10:57.501
Wishing you the best.

10:58.426 --> 11:00.571
How's the planning going?

11:00.571 --> 11:02.574
Work's burying me right now.

11:02.574 --> 11:04.780
Need it all wrapped before the wedding.

11:05.910 --> 11:08.854
The PK mess, right?

11:08.854 --> 11:11.541
Swapping out the model's no joke.

11:11.541 --> 11:12.708
No,

11:12.708 --> 11:14.294
PK stays.

11:14.294 --> 11:17.005
- Stays?
- Hold for now, per the lead.

11:17.005 --> 11:19.799
Investigation's open, see how it lands.

11:19.799 --> 11:22.955
Image is the whole thing for a model, no?

11:22.955 --> 11:24.721
Beats me.

11:24.721 --> 11:27.855
Overseas, PK still moves the needle.

11:28.676 --> 11:30.309
Honestly,

11:30.309 --> 11:32.139
makes no sense to me.

11:32.139 --> 11:34.397
Has PK got someone backing him?

11:34.397 --> 11:36.123
Huh?

11:43.875 --> 11:46.203
Anyway, congrats. See you at the wedding.

11:48.259 --> 11:49.412
Hey.

11:49.412 --> 11:51.246
Out on a meeting?

11:51.246 --> 11:52.999
Slow day for you, Noh?

11:52.999 --> 11:56.135
Coffee runs on the clock, must be nice.

11:56.135 --> 11:58.895
Coffee's just cover for intel gathering.

11:58.895 --> 12:01.016
Just reeled one in, actually.

12:01.016 --> 12:02.856
Whether it's a PM case,
that's what we need to dig into.

12:02.856 --> 12:05.777
My gut never misses on these.

12:07.426 --> 12:09.156
Spit it out.

12:11.092 --> 12:12.993
You know PK, right?

12:19.818 --> 12:24.735
Last five years,
every model contract we've signed.

12:26.991 --> 12:28.951
Stage reports too, not just the deals.

12:28.951 --> 12:31.203
Minutes, internal reviews, quotes.

12:31.203 --> 12:34.342
Email threads, the works, all in there.

12:34.342 --> 12:38.519
Comb it line by line and flag anything off.

12:38.519 --> 12:40.421
But I just meant about PK...

12:40.421 --> 12:42.700
You've got a bias against PK already.

12:42.700 --> 12:45.810
That's how you end up forcing the puzzle.

12:45.810 --> 12:47.762
Shouldn't we compare the PK issue

12:47.762 --> 12:50.170
with the others to get the full picture?

12:50.170 --> 12:51.570
Don't you think?

12:51.570 --> 12:54.701
[As Soon As Possible]
Make it ASAP.

13:01.026 --> 13:04.513
[Document List]

13:07.426 --> 13:10.435
Told you a hundred times, not going.

13:10.435 --> 13:13.551
Bunch of old guys flexing, why bother?

13:13.551 --> 13:15.331
This was on the calendar a month back.

13:15.331 --> 13:18.945
Big room tonight, ease up on the booze.

13:18.945 --> 13:20.555
Bit late for that.

13:20.555 --> 13:22.771
Already six drinks deep.

13:27.886 --> 13:30.639
This is an addiction.

13:30.639 --> 13:32.489
Let's get you help.

13:38.896 --> 13:41.187
Sorry, didn't mean to laugh.

13:45.883 --> 13:47.546
What's up?

13:49.741 --> 13:51.573
Scared?

13:52.170 --> 13:54.886
Worried I'll crack like your mom did?

14:04.964 --> 14:07.607
Quit looking at me like that.

14:11.342 --> 14:14.539
Drop the damn look!

14:46.217 --> 14:47.513
Ma'am.

14:48.340 --> 14:50.092
Aren't the kids waiting on pickup?

14:50.092 --> 14:51.903
Right, I should head out.

14:51.903 --> 14:53.865
You head out first.

14:54.930 --> 14:56.303
Wedding prep's brutal, isn't it?

14:56.303 --> 14:58.434
The list never ends.

14:58.434 --> 15:00.269
Let me know if you need any help.

15:00.269 --> 15:01.509
Thanks, I will.

15:01.509 --> 15:03.330
You can take off now.

15:04.342 --> 15:05.858
See you tomorrow.

15:05.858 --> 15:07.834
Have a good night.

15:17.453 --> 15:21.550
[P]

15:54.009 --> 15:56.560
What took you so long? Get over here.

15:56.560 --> 15:58.885
Do you know how long I've been waiting?

16:08.773 --> 16:11.600
Why are you heading back this late?
Working overtime?

16:17.137 --> 16:18.862
Hey, why do you keep acting all chummy?

16:18.862 --> 16:20.808
You're the one
who said don't acknowledge me at work.

16:20.808 --> 16:22.851
And yesterday, in front of Ms. Joo,

16:22.851 --> 16:24.861
you went and fixed my tie like this.

16:24.861 --> 16:26.362
I nearly had a heart attack.

16:26.362 --> 16:29.316
Why are you freaking out so much?

16:29.316 --> 16:31.557
Got some reason In Ah can't find out?

16:31.557 --> 16:33.221
About us?

16:33.221 --> 16:36.448
Look, let's just be careful around everyone,
okay?

16:36.448 --> 16:38.453
Bad news.

16:38.453 --> 16:40.844
In Ah already knows.

16:42.342 --> 16:45.765
That we live together.

16:47.126 --> 16:48.454
Wait, what are you talking about?

16:48.454 --> 16:50.509
When you passed out drunk the other night,

16:50.509 --> 16:52.172
In Ah was the one who dropped you off.

16:52.172 --> 16:53.773
What?

16:56.467 --> 16:58.054
Why are you only telling me now?

16:58.054 --> 17:01.414
Didn't realize it was such a big deal.

17:04.226 --> 17:06.228
Hey, did you explain it properly?
That there's nothing between us?

17:06.228 --> 17:08.940
Told her exactly how it is.

17:08.940 --> 17:11.126
That we used to date.

17:26.374 --> 17:28.632
What's up with her?

17:52.939 --> 17:54.800
Hey.

17:54.800 --> 17:56.737
You haven't headed home yet?

17:56.737 --> 17:59.032
Forgot something, came back to grab it.

17:59.032 --> 18:00.547
Done with this batch?

18:00.547 --> 18:02.242
Really, I can handle this on my own.

18:02.242 --> 18:05.136
Too much overtime pay hurts the company.

18:17.217 --> 18:19.407
Have you eaten?

18:19.407 --> 18:21.187
Want some of this?

18:21.187 --> 18:23.097
I'm good.

18:23.097 --> 18:24.474
Okay.

18:35.800 --> 18:39.673
You took me all the way home?

18:39.673 --> 18:42.716
Yeah. You should drop a few pounds.

18:43.693 --> 18:47.846
Well, it's all muscle, so the weight kind of...

18:58.757 --> 19:01.786
Secretary Park and I are just friends.

19:01.786 --> 19:03.220
Separate rooms,

19:03.220 --> 19:05.737
and we barely cross paths
since we're both busy.

19:05.737 --> 19:08.518
So it's more like a housemate situation...

19:08.518 --> 19:09.644
Hey,

19:09.644 --> 19:12.731
you don't need to break all that down for me.

19:12.731 --> 19:14.789
That's your personal life.

19:19.467 --> 19:22.357
You're not curious about my personal life?

19:22.357 --> 19:24.466
The guy who kissed you?

19:27.634 --> 19:29.465
Not curious.

19:29.465 --> 19:30.766
Drop it too.

19:30.766 --> 19:33.425
Weren't you supposed to play it cool?

19:33.425 --> 19:35.883
Then,

19:35.883 --> 19:38.146
how about answering my question?

19:39.864 --> 19:42.400
The reason you keep pushing me away.

19:48.534 --> 19:52.227
Asking whether I'm seeing someone?

19:52.227 --> 19:54.825
That sounds way too personal.

19:54.825 --> 19:56.399
We're working right now.

19:56.399 --> 19:57.900
Let's drop this here,

19:57.900 --> 19:59.671
and keep things strictly work.

19:59.671 --> 20:01.795
What if it's a work question?

20:04.364 --> 20:06.341
What do you mean by that?

20:07.367 --> 20:10.232
How could my love life be work-related?

20:10.232 --> 20:11.955
It can be.

20:11.955 --> 20:14.709
Depends on the guy you're seeing.

20:45.280 --> 20:47.950
He's staying out all night?

20:47.950 --> 20:50.969
[Model Casting Proposal]

22:15.925 --> 22:18.342
Even without bias, this looks shady.

22:18.342 --> 22:19.916
Group brand model PK,

22:19.916 --> 22:21.551
back in '20 for the first contract,

22:21.551 --> 22:24.646
got paid 300 million won
when nobody knew his name.

22:25.922 --> 22:28.383
Then in '21, the renewal
jumped straight to one billion.

22:28.383 --> 22:29.836
[A billion won]

22:30.552 --> 22:32.039
Doesn't seem like an issue, does it?

22:32.039 --> 22:33.407
He blew up in between.

22:33.407 --> 22:35.765
The figure lines up with model rates back then.

22:35.765 --> 22:38.310
- Coverage was pretty wide too.
- Right.

22:38.310 --> 22:40.313
That part checks out, but...

22:41.561 --> 22:44.107
between image fatigue
and ongoing acting controversies,

22:44.107 --> 22:48.111
his stock is crashing right now, and yet...

22:48.111 --> 22:50.500
they renew him again at five billion won.

22:50.500 --> 22:53.528
Even switching the terms to a three-year deal.

22:53.528 --> 22:56.695
This isn't getting played,

22:56.695 --> 23:00.223
this looks like someone got blackmailed.

23:02.175 --> 23:04.123
You know what's the sketchiest part?

23:04.123 --> 23:06.133
When renewal talks come up,

23:06.133 --> 23:08.841
other models have internal departments

23:08.841 --> 23:11.008
plus outside agencies and reps

23:11.008 --> 23:13.342
exchanging a massive amount of communication.

23:13.342 --> 23:15.555
But with PK,

23:15.555 --> 23:17.308
none of that shows up at all.

23:17.308 --> 23:19.476
No in-person agency meetings,

23:19.476 --> 23:22.979
zero emails between either side.

23:22.979 --> 23:25.175
If something that should be there isn't,

23:25.175 --> 23:28.550
that hints something else was going on instead.

23:28.550 --> 23:30.169
Exactly.

23:31.698 --> 23:33.425
The thing is,

23:33.425 --> 23:35.658
how do we actually prove it?

23:35.658 --> 23:37.202
While you were going through the paperwork,

23:37.202 --> 23:40.413
I dug around PK's social media a bit.

23:40.413 --> 23:41.693
Sorry?

23:42.832 --> 23:44.627
You were having fun on your own?

23:44.627 --> 23:46.838
This must've been a blast.

23:46.838 --> 23:49.248
What're you saying?
My eyes were about to fall out.

23:49.248 --> 23:50.883
Look at the veins popping.

23:50.883 --> 23:52.566
Where?

24:05.333 --> 24:06.900
Anyway,

24:06.900 --> 24:10.255
PK posted a photo back in March '20.

24:11.634 --> 24:13.155
Here, this is the one.

24:13.155 --> 24:15.258
The place screams expensive,

24:15.258 --> 24:18.136
so I ran a search using this window as a clue,

24:18.136 --> 24:19.467
and it turns out to be a place in Osaka, Japan,

24:19.467 --> 24:22.874
a stupidly expensive private hot spring.

24:22.874 --> 24:26.342
He's a celebrity,
so dates like this make sense.

24:26.342 --> 24:27.935
Sure.

24:29.129 --> 24:31.092
But of all times, right around then,

24:31.092 --> 24:34.013
the timing lines up too perfectly,

24:34.013 --> 24:37.504
one of our employees swiped
the corporate card in Osaka.

24:37.504 --> 24:39.389
Charged it and canceled right after, sure,

24:39.389 --> 24:40.883
but whether guilt got to them

24:40.883 --> 24:42.684
or they were being careful
not to leave a trail,

24:42.684 --> 24:45.036
that part I can't tell.

24:46.688 --> 24:48.133
Yeah, but...

24:48.133 --> 24:51.682
tons of Koreans travel there all the time,

24:51.682 --> 24:55.046
so it might just be a coincidence.

24:55.904 --> 24:58.007
But what if that Korean

24:59.784 --> 25:02.912
turned out to be the one calling shots on PK?

25:02.912 --> 25:05.014
Changes things, doesn't it?

25:08.001 --> 25:10.276
[Team Leader Han Ji Won]

25:21.067 --> 25:22.934
Trouble reading Korean?

25:22.934 --> 25:25.326
You're taking forever.

25:26.894 --> 25:28.813
[Standard Contract: Ad Model PK]

25:28.813 --> 25:30.023
No rush.

25:30.023 --> 25:31.300
Look it over carefully.

25:31.300 --> 25:33.209
Thank you.

25:40.217 --> 25:44.098
Every model gets picked by the book.

25:44.098 --> 25:45.883
With PK though,

25:45.883 --> 25:48.124
trust had built up over so many years,

25:48.124 --> 25:50.538
some corners might have gotten cut.

25:50.538 --> 25:52.238
And Japan?

25:52.238 --> 25:54.358
That part really was a coincidence.

25:54.358 --> 25:58.360
Took a family trip with the kids and their dad,

25:58.360 --> 26:00.303
and I mixed up my cards,

26:00.303 --> 26:02.651
swiped the corporate card
at a convenience store by mistake

26:02.651 --> 26:04.573
and canceled right away.

26:05.600 --> 26:07.895
A family trip, huh?

26:07.895 --> 26:11.257
Mind if I see the photos from that trip?

26:11.257 --> 26:13.066
Yeah, I'd love to show you,

26:13.066 --> 26:15.028
but I switched phones recently,

26:15.028 --> 26:16.679
and none of the photos carried over.

26:16.679 --> 26:17.864
Gosh.

26:17.864 --> 26:20.158
You lost every single photo of your kids?

26:20.158 --> 26:22.617
And no cloud backup either?

26:22.617 --> 26:25.538
Right? Tech really isn't my thing.

26:25.538 --> 26:27.558
Hand over the phone.

26:27.558 --> 26:31.358
- Sorry?
- I don't buy it, so unlock the phone.

26:31.358 --> 26:34.619
Am I actually required to do that?

26:34.619 --> 26:36.798
This is standard investigation procedure.

26:36.798 --> 26:39.384
You'll fill out and submit a consent form,

26:39.384 --> 26:42.869
and refusing is your right too.

26:42.869 --> 26:46.615
But nothing good comes out of that route.

26:49.060 --> 26:51.175
Family trip, my foot.

26:51.175 --> 26:52.550
What Korean mom would

26:52.550 --> 26:54.524
pull her firstborn out of school in March,

26:54.524 --> 26:57.962
right after first grade started,
for a hot spring trip?

26:57.962 --> 27:00.683
Already know your husband didn't go.

27:00.683 --> 27:02.756
Confirmed it all.

27:18.967 --> 27:20.774
Dating.

27:22.595 --> 27:24.406
PK and I,

27:26.592 --> 27:28.657
we're a couple.

27:38.717 --> 27:41.683
Team Leader Han caved way too easily.

27:41.683 --> 27:44.282
The background check pegged her as stubborn

27:44.282 --> 27:46.951
and tough-minded,

27:46.951 --> 27:49.803
so I had a few more interview scripts ready.

27:50.830 --> 27:52.556
Busy tonight?

28:07.599 --> 28:09.406
Oh my.

28:25.925 --> 28:27.660
Min Yul, sit up straight.

28:27.660 --> 28:31.050
- Buckle up properly.
- Let me grab it.

28:31.050 --> 28:33.430
- Got it.
- Dong Yoon, you're here.

28:35.258 --> 28:38.060
Hey, not even saying hi to your mom?

28:39.509 --> 28:41.855
Kids, no running.

28:43.008 --> 28:44.845
Hey, off the game.

28:44.845 --> 28:46.382
Honey.

28:46.382 --> 28:47.428
I'm sorry.

28:47.428 --> 28:50.003
Barely escaped
when the boss pushed for round two.

28:50.003 --> 28:53.534
- Good job.
- Hey Dong Yoon, dad's right here and no hello?

28:55.217 --> 28:57.322
Hey, aren't these the dumplings you love?

28:57.322 --> 28:58.762
Can I try one?

28:58.762 --> 29:00.383
- Try one.
- No thanks.

29:00.383 --> 29:02.391
- Just try it.
- Stop it.

29:05.905 --> 29:07.699
Marriage looks rock solid for them.

29:07.699 --> 29:09.118
Sure does.

29:09.118 --> 29:12.758
With this kind of schedule,
where would Han find time to date?

29:12.758 --> 29:15.097
Thank you.

29:16.758 --> 29:19.518
Dong Yoon, drop the game already.

29:36.838 --> 29:38.839
Han really claims to be PK's girlfriend?

29:38.839 --> 29:40.148
And that's why she gave him special treatment?

29:40.148 --> 29:42.679
Is this one of those sponsor situations?

29:42.679 --> 29:44.652
Where would she even get that kind of money?

29:44.652 --> 29:47.160
Does a marketing leader pull
way more than an audit leader?

29:47.160 --> 29:47.899
Not really.

29:47.899 --> 29:51.367
He kept saying work eats up all his time,
no dating,

29:51.367 --> 29:55.121
acting all innocent
like fans were his whole world.

29:55.121 --> 29:58.124
Look, I didn't swallow that line completely,

29:58.124 --> 30:00.298
but this still crosses a line, right?

30:00.298 --> 30:01.419
Seriously, how...

30:01.419 --> 30:04.733
could a married mom of three be his sponsor?

30:04.733 --> 30:08.067
Honestly, the embarrassment is mine.

30:14.474 --> 30:15.592
Da Ye, what's up?

30:15.592 --> 30:17.050
What're you doing?

30:17.050 --> 30:19.469
Why the sudden cleanup?

30:20.883 --> 30:23.013
- What...
- Gosh.

30:25.509 --> 30:26.793
What's going on?

30:26.793 --> 30:28.962
- This is...
- What's wrong with her?

30:30.092 --> 30:32.216
It's PK merch.

30:32.965 --> 30:35.509
So when PK had his accident,

30:35.509 --> 30:38.758
the passenger never got identified?

30:38.758 --> 30:40.875
Right, there's zero info out there,

30:40.875 --> 30:43.565
and reporters are pulling their hair out too.

30:43.565 --> 30:47.217
If Han is making it all up,

30:47.217 --> 30:48.424
why on earth?

30:48.424 --> 30:50.651
Getting caught means instant termination.

30:51.553 --> 30:54.182
Maybe something scares her
more than getting fired.

31:00.217 --> 31:03.205
I told you,
you shouldn't give it this much water.

31:04.673 --> 31:07.084
"I told you"?

31:07.902 --> 31:09.962
Excuse me, but isn't that a bit too casual?

31:13.115 --> 31:15.926
Short and sweet is a virtue, you know.

31:16.967 --> 31:18.762
Hey...

31:24.092 --> 31:26.297
The more I think about it, the weirder it gets.

31:26.297 --> 31:28.883
Han being PK's girlfriend, I mean.

31:28.883 --> 31:30.758
The women PK has dated,

31:30.758 --> 31:32.844
idol Ha Jung Yoon, actress Yang Hee Seung,

31:32.844 --> 31:35.274
hotel heiress Cho Moon Joo,
influencer Lee Ji Hyun.

31:35.274 --> 31:36.931
Every one of them puppy-faced,

31:36.931 --> 31:39.832
petite and the cute type, right?

31:39.832 --> 31:42.103
But Han is super tall

31:42.103 --> 31:44.524
and totally cat-faced.

31:44.524 --> 31:46.818
On top of that, married.

31:46.818 --> 31:49.460
And not chaebol-level for the sponsor angle.

31:50.342 --> 31:51.990
Ms. Yoon,

31:51.990 --> 31:54.965
you know an awful lot about PK.

31:56.634 --> 31:59.128
Used to be a fan.

31:59.128 --> 32:01.263
Just quit the fandom now.

32:02.592 --> 32:05.559
Sounds like you were a hardcore fan.

32:06.217 --> 32:10.174
So anything come to mind?

32:10.174 --> 32:13.717
Rumors going around the fandom maybe,

32:13.717 --> 32:17.946
or some private social media account of PK's.

32:22.352 --> 32:25.271
There's a notorious stalker fan

32:25.271 --> 32:27.706
in the PK fandom.

32:28.300 --> 32:31.634
He posted threats claiming

32:31.634 --> 32:34.421
to have photos from the night of the accident.

32:36.411 --> 32:39.176
He might know something useful.

32:40.995 --> 32:42.855
[Stay strong PK, we've got your back]

32:54.384 --> 32:56.644
You're PK Rabbit, right?

32:56.644 --> 32:58.348
The hoodie gave you away.

32:58.348 --> 33:00.489
Cute rabbit, by the way.

33:02.008 --> 33:03.700
Gosh.

33:09.439 --> 33:12.918
I'm the one who sent the DM,

33:13.653 --> 33:15.841
about the photocard trade.

33:15.841 --> 33:18.524
Is it really a photocard trade?

33:18.524 --> 33:22.136
Not another big-corp person, right?

33:22.136 --> 33:25.472
I'm from a big corp, but how did you...

33:27.175 --> 33:28.592
Wait.

33:28.592 --> 33:30.419
What's wrong?

33:30.419 --> 33:33.522
What's wrong with you?

33:43.099 --> 33:46.483
The photos I handed over last time,
that's everything.

33:46.483 --> 33:48.398
There aren't any copies.

33:48.398 --> 33:50.233
- And one more thing.
- Yes.

33:50.233 --> 33:51.853
I'll quit the fandom.

33:51.853 --> 33:53.859
And no more taking those photos either.

33:53.859 --> 33:56.112
I'll stop chasing PK forever.

33:56.112 --> 33:58.364
- Hey, why're you doing this, get up.
- So please just...

33:58.364 --> 34:01.467
- leave me alone, okay?
- What in the world?

34:01.467 --> 34:03.217
- No.
- This kind of thing is

34:03.217 --> 34:05.929
straight-up big-corp bullying.

34:19.300 --> 34:22.362
Which big corporation are you talking about?

34:25.185 --> 34:30.213
Aren't you from Sesan Group?

34:31.314 --> 34:33.332
Sesan Group?

34:35.092 --> 34:37.030
The original photo files.

34:37.030 --> 34:39.796
Confirmed no copies exist either.

34:47.258 --> 34:49.306
Nice work.

34:50.416 --> 34:52.267
Nailed it.

34:57.383 --> 35:02.903
Did you actually tell them we're dating?

35:04.930 --> 35:07.050
And they bought it?

35:07.050 --> 35:09.159
Bunch of idiots.

35:11.133 --> 35:13.942
I'll get your husband transferred
to the Europe branch.

35:13.942 --> 35:15.791
Slip away quietly.

35:37.316 --> 35:40.440
They say a former fan
turned hater is the worst.

35:42.300 --> 35:44.008
But seriously,

35:44.008 --> 35:46.175
I fangirled over PK
for years right next to you,

35:46.175 --> 35:49.243
how did you never let it slip even once?

35:49.243 --> 35:50.909
Unbelievable.

35:51.903 --> 35:53.730
Da Ye.

35:53.730 --> 35:57.191
Making friends at work
isn't your thing, I get it,

35:57.191 --> 35:59.459
but that was still pretty harsh.

36:08.496 --> 36:10.864
Isn't it fan club goods?

36:10.864 --> 36:13.495
And first generation, no less?

36:13.495 --> 36:15.509
The resale price on these is no joke.

36:15.509 --> 36:17.065
Tossing them is such a waste,

36:17.065 --> 36:18.225
who does that benefit?

36:18.225 --> 36:20.883
Sell them and treat yourself
to tteokbokki at least.

36:20.883 --> 36:22.524
Right?

36:25.208 --> 36:26.637
Well...

36:26.637 --> 36:29.477
Today, my treat works too.

36:29.477 --> 36:31.934
I've already moved a few.

36:31.934 --> 36:34.036
Made me rich.

36:42.444 --> 36:44.629
Tteokbokki,

36:46.008 --> 36:48.008
how could I pass?

36:49.592 --> 36:51.386
Let's go.

36:52.580 --> 36:54.749
Hold up.

36:54.749 --> 36:56.250
What kind of tteokbokki do you like?

36:56.250 --> 36:57.606
Wheat cake or rice cake?

36:57.606 --> 36:59.925
Rice cake for me.

36:59.925 --> 37:01.257
Be straight with me.

37:01.257 --> 37:02.746
Spit it out honestly.

37:02.746 --> 37:05.925
Sounds like we share the same taste here.

37:05.925 --> 37:07.841
Pick up the ball.

37:07.841 --> 37:09.676
Someone could get hurt.

37:09.676 --> 37:11.531
Min Yul.

37:18.967 --> 37:20.816
So,

37:20.816 --> 37:22.876
any good with the ball?

37:24.883 --> 37:26.175
Hey.

37:26.175 --> 37:27.740
Got you!

37:27.740 --> 37:29.758
Hey, this...

37:31.634 --> 37:33.678
Pass it.

37:34.455 --> 37:35.531
What are you doing?

37:35.531 --> 37:37.717
- Help me out.
- What're you doing?

37:37.717 --> 37:40.143
No way!

37:42.152 --> 37:44.031
Foul!

37:44.031 --> 37:46.634
Stop!

37:46.634 --> 37:48.384
Line up right here.

37:48.384 --> 37:51.092
Hey, dirty plays like that
aren't okay, alright?

37:51.092 --> 37:53.142
Keep things fair.

37:53.142 --> 37:55.033
Right?

37:57.603 --> 38:00.624
Go have fun!

38:03.717 --> 38:05.794
My back.

38:13.745 --> 38:16.791
Three boys to raise plus a marketing lead role,

38:16.791 --> 38:19.099
Han, that's impressive.

38:21.710 --> 38:23.854
Dating on top of it all.

38:24.841 --> 38:26.982
No date tonight?

38:29.967 --> 38:31.723
He works at Sesan Group, right?

38:31.723 --> 38:33.446
Your husband.

38:35.009 --> 38:37.430
That must've turned into your weak spot.

38:37.430 --> 38:39.299
At our company maybe not,

38:39.299 --> 38:42.414
but her pull at Sesan can't be brushed aside.

38:52.217 --> 38:55.286
Looks like you came knowing everything.

38:55.286 --> 38:57.913
What's your move from here?

38:57.913 --> 38:59.164
What did they ask of you?

38:59.164 --> 39:00.960
Told me to ship out overseas.

39:00.960 --> 39:03.923
Said they'd transfer my husband's posting.

39:03.923 --> 39:06.096
Once I'm gone,

39:06.096 --> 39:08.968
the case fizzles without a key party,

39:08.968 --> 39:11.568
and PK keeps the contract.

39:12.636 --> 39:14.509
The two lovebirds keep going strong,

39:14.509 --> 39:16.974
and you alone wind up

39:16.974 --> 39:21.077
the talk of the town as the sponsor
who got busted and bolted abroad?

39:22.187 --> 39:25.167
Sounds like the makings of a legend.

39:26.361 --> 39:30.027
Joining at twenty-five
and grinding for fifteen years

39:30.027 --> 39:32.214
amounts to nothing in the end?

39:32.965 --> 39:36.760
That level of gossip would actually be tame.

39:37.369 --> 39:39.800
Told them I'm a coworker friend of yours,

39:39.800 --> 39:41.865
the second kid Min Wook over there, right?

39:41.865 --> 39:43.805
Min Wook hit me with this.

39:43.805 --> 39:45.546
Asks if I'm friends with the chief then.

39:45.546 --> 39:49.005
Said his mom runs the show at work,

39:49.005 --> 39:53.258
told me not to give
the chief grief and listen up.

39:53.258 --> 39:56.126
Looks out for his mom hard,
even if listening's another story.

39:56.126 --> 39:57.574
Right?

39:58.182 --> 40:01.368
He keeps calling me "Chief"...

40:06.394 --> 40:08.208
Want some help?

40:12.634 --> 40:16.049
I make a pretty handy shield.

40:17.284 --> 40:19.254
Care to put me to use?

40:19.254 --> 40:20.935
I made a promise to the kids too,

40:20.935 --> 40:22.931
to keep the chief safe.

40:36.004 --> 40:37.304
Alright.

40:37.304 --> 40:39.258
All set, back in action.

40:39.258 --> 40:41.825
Square up for round two.

41:03.050 --> 41:05.598
My ball.

41:06.342 --> 41:07.384
Alright.

41:07.384 --> 41:09.686
Min Yul, pass it to me.

41:11.338 --> 41:14.091
The reason A was able to pressure marketing

41:14.091 --> 41:17.553
into giving Model B special treatment

41:17.553 --> 41:20.888
traces back to flaws
in our ad production system.

41:21.704 --> 41:22.973
To address that, here are ways

41:22.973 --> 41:24.592
to tighten procedural transparency
in model selection...

41:24.592 --> 41:26.703
Hold up.

41:27.563 --> 41:30.318
So who exactly is this A?

41:30.318 --> 41:32.359
Model B is clearly PK,

41:32.359 --> 41:34.124
but A's identity has to come out, right?

41:34.124 --> 41:35.284
Are you trying to kill us with suspense?

41:35.284 --> 41:37.030
The name itself isn't the core issue.

41:37.030 --> 41:39.384
Naming names also opens up defamation risk.

41:39.384 --> 41:42.024
Come on, are we strangers here?

41:42.024 --> 41:44.163
Defamation, really? That stings.

41:44.163 --> 41:47.523
Apologies for not laying out every detail,

41:47.523 --> 41:49.793
but if A's identity gets out,

41:49.793 --> 41:52.713
the corporate risk balloons even bigger,

41:52.713 --> 41:54.676
so please bear with me on this.

41:54.676 --> 41:59.527
Honestly, who is this person?

42:02.681 --> 42:04.224
Hyun Young.

42:04.224 --> 42:06.534
What brings you here?

42:13.384 --> 42:15.668
Which one of you is Joo In Ah?

42:34.023 --> 42:36.133
Who do you think you are, dropping PK?

42:36.133 --> 42:39.051
Who the hell do you think you are,
you crazy bitch?

42:39.051 --> 42:40.179
Who are you to drop him?

42:40.179 --> 42:42.335
Who do you think you are, huh?

42:46.509 --> 42:48.050
What do you think you're doing?

42:48.050 --> 42:49.676
Let go.

42:49.676 --> 42:51.517
Let go!

42:51.517 --> 42:53.540
Let go!

43:00.823 --> 43:03.550
[Vice Chairman's Office]

43:04.358 --> 43:08.258
Jeon Jae Yeol, lost your mind? Huh?

43:08.258 --> 43:10.348
Answer me!

43:12.008 --> 43:13.839
Who are you people to drop PK?

43:13.839 --> 43:16.175
Who are you to lay a finger on him?

43:16.175 --> 43:17.918
Can't you hear me?

43:17.918 --> 43:21.092
Hey, give me an answer.

43:21.092 --> 43:23.445
Hey, answer me!

43:37.634 --> 43:39.592
Am I some kind of joke to you?

43:39.592 --> 43:42.550
Why blow up over something so small?

43:42.550 --> 43:45.761
You aren't jealous, are you?

43:45.761 --> 43:48.495
Have I ever said a word

43:48.495 --> 43:50.592
about who you see on the side?

43:50.592 --> 43:53.122
At the bare minimum,
the company shouldn't get dragged in.

43:53.122 --> 43:55.380
Did I take a bribe? Did I do anything?

43:55.380 --> 43:58.521
You guys pull worse crap and still come at me.

43:59.381 --> 44:01.902
Could you say the same in front of your father?

44:01.902 --> 44:03.361
Just try it.

44:03.361 --> 44:05.300
I'll kill myself.

44:05.300 --> 44:07.470
Try.

44:07.470 --> 44:09.490
Take your shot if you can.

44:11.467 --> 44:13.645
You crossed the line

44:13.645 --> 44:15.958
this time, big-time.

44:17.676 --> 44:19.568
Pick a country and fly out immediately.

44:19.568 --> 44:22.253
Don't even think about coming back for a while.

44:48.013 --> 44:50.112
What kind of Head of Audit
takes hits like this?

44:50.112 --> 44:53.060
Day after day getting beaten, banged up,

44:53.060 --> 44:54.830
cursed at.

44:55.479 --> 44:56.774
That really stings.

44:56.774 --> 44:59.374
Could you ease up and skip the feelings?

45:01.550 --> 45:02.989
Alright.

45:02.989 --> 45:04.486
Come closer.

45:09.425 --> 45:11.043
All done.

45:13.586 --> 45:15.713
That hurts.

45:15.713 --> 45:17.600
Such a baby.

45:19.467 --> 45:21.266
And what happened to your leg?

45:21.266 --> 45:23.467
One side bruised, the other cut up.

45:23.467 --> 45:24.549
Oh, this?

45:24.549 --> 45:27.384
The Son Heung Min of Mapo-dong slid into me.

45:27.384 --> 45:29.404
Wait, you play soccer too?

45:30.431 --> 45:32.560
You've got plenty of hobbies.

45:33.934 --> 45:35.386
Did you disinfect this at all?

45:35.386 --> 45:36.603
It's fine, leave it.

45:36.603 --> 45:38.621
This'll heal up in no time.

45:41.300 --> 45:43.418
Hold still a second.

45:51.300 --> 45:54.585
Models can't have marks on the body,
you know that?

45:54.585 --> 45:56.764
Zero professionalism.

46:25.405 --> 46:28.151
About that question you asked...

46:31.450 --> 46:34.594
The real reason behind pushing you away.

46:40.883 --> 46:42.935
I...

46:50.230 --> 46:52.278
I...

47:03.634 --> 47:05.025
Mr. Noh.

47:05.025 --> 47:06.813
That woman who just left,

47:06.813 --> 47:08.461
Joo In Ah, right?

47:09.530 --> 47:10.752
Getting shot down again?

47:10.752 --> 47:12.840
It's nothing, get to work.

47:20.342 --> 47:22.800
Ms. Joo.

47:22.800 --> 47:25.395
Let me apologize on her behalf.

47:43.647 --> 47:45.194
[Non-Disclosure Agreement]

47:45.194 --> 47:49.318
This NDA covers staying quiet
about what happened today.

47:49.318 --> 47:50.324
What for?

47:50.324 --> 47:53.156
Worried I'll run my mouth
about the Vice Chairman's wife

47:53.156 --> 47:54.692
being a total psycho?

47:54.692 --> 47:56.550
Just covering the bases.

47:56.550 --> 47:59.467
Everyone who was there has to sign one.

47:59.467 --> 48:01.248
Don't read too much into it.

48:01.248 --> 48:03.641
Sign at the bottom.

48:08.050 --> 48:11.130
Bit of a surprise, right?

48:11.925 --> 48:15.800
On the surface,
the Vice Chairman looks flawless.

48:15.800 --> 48:18.932
But once you peel it back...

48:18.932 --> 48:20.795
[Signed by Noh Ki Jun]
His life's pretty rough.

48:23.717 --> 48:28.082
I guess everyone's carrying something.

48:29.258 --> 48:32.587
So is that what pulled you toward him?

48:34.841 --> 48:37.006
You knew this whole time?

48:37.006 --> 48:40.290
Hey, I can read a room.

48:40.290 --> 48:43.379
No wonder you handle PM.

48:43.379 --> 48:46.767
Joo In Ah really knows talent when she sees it.

48:49.080 --> 48:53.175
- It's over now, right?
- Speaking of reading rooms...

48:53.175 --> 48:56.068
What's the deal between you and Joo In Ah?

48:57.300 --> 48:59.447
Is there something there?

49:03.883 --> 49:05.361
Hey, where are you running off to?

49:05.361 --> 49:07.830
Off to find out what we are.

49:16.198 --> 49:17.799
- Hey, Doo Gi.
- Yes?

49:17.799 --> 49:19.050
Where did Ms. Joo go?

49:19.050 --> 49:20.399
She took half a day off.

49:20.399 --> 49:21.458
Crazy, right?

49:21.458 --> 49:23.676
She never uses a single day off all year.

49:23.676 --> 49:25.290
Something must be up.

49:25.290 --> 49:27.459
Put me down for a half day too.

49:27.459 --> 49:28.518
Do me a favor.

49:28.518 --> 49:30.144
Sorry?

49:31.299 --> 49:33.883
A half day, out of nowhere?

49:33.883 --> 49:37.485
Your call has been forwarded to voicemail...

50:05.330 --> 50:07.000
[Joo In Ah]

50:11.008 --> 50:15.147
Your call has been forwarded to voicemail...

50:20.967 --> 50:22.196
[Ms. Joo...]

50:31.022 --> 50:33.332
This is going to scar.

50:42.659 --> 50:44.077
[Reporting Head of Audit Joo In Ah]

50:44.077 --> 50:45.245
[Joo In Ah's carrying
on an inappropriate relationship at work]

50:45.245 --> 50:46.359
[Attached is the proof]

50:50.050 --> 50:51.976
No way...

52:00.967 --> 52:02.880
Joo In Ah.

52:05.286 --> 52:07.551
Ms. Joo!

52:34.649 --> 52:36.315
[Revital Retreat]

52:52.873 --> 52:55.175
You made it, Ms. Joo.

52:55.175 --> 52:57.169
Bro, don't even get me started.

52:57.169 --> 52:58.434
She kept saying she wouldn't come.

52:58.434 --> 53:02.051
So I went to her place
and basically dragged her here.

53:02.051 --> 53:03.899
Mr. Noh.

53:07.637 --> 53:10.432
Right, the one
who did the presentation earlier.

53:10.432 --> 53:12.783
What brings you all the way out here?

53:13.433 --> 53:15.453
Well, the thing is...

53:17.425 --> 53:20.258
Something urgent came up for Ms. Joo.

53:20.258 --> 53:21.876
Yes.

53:27.073 --> 53:29.022
Now that's a dedicated employee.

53:29.022 --> 53:30.441
Impressive.

53:30.441 --> 53:31.870
All right, then.

53:31.870 --> 53:33.702
Take your time talking it through.

53:33.702 --> 53:35.322
We're about to eat anyway.

53:35.322 --> 53:37.250
He came all this way.

53:37.250 --> 53:38.841
Feed him some sashimi before he goes.

53:38.841 --> 53:39.961
Stay and eat.

53:39.961 --> 53:41.001
Will do.

53:41.001 --> 53:42.772
Shall we?

54:00.231 --> 54:03.318
This must be some executive event.

54:03.318 --> 54:05.335
They sure picked a fancy spot.

54:05.335 --> 54:07.546
So what's the emergency?

54:12.758 --> 54:14.475
Aren't you going to feed me sashimi?

54:14.475 --> 54:16.597
Sashimi happens to be my favorite.

54:20.467 --> 54:21.676
This is unreal.

54:21.676 --> 54:24.355
It's fresh and the texture's killer.

54:24.355 --> 54:26.774
Please dig in already.

54:28.268 --> 54:30.178
Look, I should be...

54:30.178 --> 54:31.989
Wrapping some up for you.

54:31.989 --> 54:33.548
How about we get to it now?

54:33.548 --> 54:35.908
What's this urgent thing you came for?

54:36.508 --> 54:38.770
Well, see...

54:38.770 --> 54:41.359
It's all sorted out.

54:41.359 --> 54:42.608
Already?

54:42.608 --> 54:44.776
You drove all the way out here

54:44.776 --> 54:46.194
for something that easy?

54:46.194 --> 54:49.004
Quick fix is a good thing, isn't it?

54:51.050 --> 54:52.363
Here.

54:56.217 --> 54:58.793
Eat up yourself.

54:58.793 --> 55:01.010
Don't be cold.

55:10.014 --> 55:12.509
You've got quite the appetite.

55:12.509 --> 55:15.473
Tell me you didn't really come for the sashimi.

55:15.473 --> 55:17.199
Oh come on,

55:17.199 --> 55:18.855
here, take some.

55:18.855 --> 55:20.615
Eat up.

55:20.615 --> 55:22.442
Don't drink soju on an empty stomach.

55:22.442 --> 55:25.255
Or have a drink with me, here.

55:25.255 --> 55:26.917
Cheers!

55:36.258 --> 55:37.894
That hits the spot.

55:37.894 --> 55:40.474
Why'd you take a half day so suddenly?

55:40.474 --> 55:43.001
Everyone's freaking out when you do that.

55:43.001 --> 55:46.546
Heading back to the office like this
after the executive meeting?

55:46.546 --> 55:48.467
Weird rumors would start flying.

55:48.467 --> 55:49.808
Got it.

55:51.676 --> 55:54.509
Anyway, since it's sorted,
let's eat up and head out.

55:54.509 --> 55:55.634
Let's take our time.

55:55.634 --> 55:59.008
MD Jeon told us to come back slowly anyway.

55:59.008 --> 56:00.893
Just...

56:00.893 --> 56:02.427
look at this place.

56:02.427 --> 56:05.372
It's been a while since I've seen the ocean.

56:07.384 --> 56:09.293
It's like a date.

56:16.412 --> 56:19.637
You really keep it simple.

56:27.175 --> 56:28.614
Exactly.

56:28.614 --> 56:30.924
So just give me a simple answer.

56:30.924 --> 56:31.965
Answer to what?

56:31.965 --> 56:33.609
The thing earlier.

56:34.967 --> 56:36.720
Where you cut yourself off.

56:36.720 --> 56:40.259
About that question you asked...

56:40.259 --> 56:43.202
The real reason behind pushing you away.

56:46.064 --> 56:47.486
I...

56:52.050 --> 56:54.046
Oh, that.

57:04.332 --> 57:06.183
The thing is...

57:21.841 --> 57:23.800
It slipped my mind.

57:23.800 --> 57:24.967
What I was about to say...

57:24.967 --> 57:27.596
It's totally gone,
my head's all over the place.

57:28.189 --> 57:30.085
Maybe I'll try some sashimi.

57:32.491 --> 57:34.611
This really is delicious.

57:34.611 --> 57:36.911
Eat plenty. Should we get spicy stew?

57:36.911 --> 57:39.752
Sir, make the spicy stew nice and fiery.

57:39.752 --> 57:41.844
Two bowls of rice too.

57:43.291 --> 57:44.888
Cheers.

57:47.875 --> 57:49.772
Looks like your glass is empty.

57:53.603 --> 57:55.190
Cheers.

58:07.687 --> 58:09.258
No way, at the cafe?

58:09.258 --> 58:11.403
I nearly had a heart attack.

58:11.403 --> 58:13.151
In front of everyone too.

58:13.151 --> 58:14.717
He came at me like he'd throw a punch.

58:14.717 --> 58:17.254
Then just dropped to his knees.

58:18.220 --> 58:21.091
I can picture the look on your face.

58:34.761 --> 58:36.523
Watch it.

58:39.722 --> 58:42.237
The nerve on you.

58:44.967 --> 58:46.501
Hands off.

58:46.501 --> 58:48.660
You're the one who tripped.

58:49.550 --> 58:51.814
"You"?

58:51.814 --> 58:54.041
You're really pushing it...

59:07.917 --> 59:10.132
Did it really slip your mind?

59:11.050 --> 59:13.477
What you were about to tell me.

59:15.676 --> 59:18.273
Why can't you just be straight with me?

59:25.425 --> 59:26.728
You!

59:26.728 --> 59:28.592
Why'd you come here?

59:28.592 --> 59:30.702
What's the emergency?

59:34.592 --> 59:36.959
You lied too, though.

59:37.925 --> 59:40.002
No, that was...

59:40.002 --> 59:42.634
It's embarrassing to admit.

59:42.634 --> 59:45.967
Honestly, I chased you down out of rage.

59:45.967 --> 59:47.384
I went by your place.

59:47.384 --> 59:50.008
Saw you getting into MD Jeon's car
and got the wrong idea.

59:50.008 --> 59:53.008
I lost it and floored it all the way here.

59:53.008 --> 59:54.301
Pretty funny, right?

59:54.301 --> 59:56.481
It's not like I'm your husband.

59:56.481 --> 59:58.105
Hold on.

59:59.050 --> 01:00:01.358
Me and MD Jeon?

01:00:05.263 --> 01:00:08.161
That's why you called my name
in such a scary way.

01:00:08.161 --> 01:00:09.942
You looked ready to throw hands.

01:00:09.942 --> 01:00:12.327
That's why I'm losing it.

01:00:16.550 --> 01:00:19.550
I've kind of snapped.

01:00:19.550 --> 01:00:21.378
All because of you.

01:00:26.996 --> 01:00:29.178
Quit playing dumb.

01:00:30.175 --> 01:00:32.181
The cat's out of the bag.

01:00:34.967 --> 01:00:37.311
I'm into you.

01:00:41.841 --> 01:00:43.696
Hey, look!

01:00:44.923 --> 01:00:46.843
Hey, where are you going?

01:00:46.843 --> 01:00:48.739
Hold on, come over here!

01:00:52.967 --> 01:00:55.204
You said you liked stuffed animals, right?

01:01:03.075 --> 01:01:05.797
Let's win one.

01:01:10.095 --> 01:01:12.429
Grab it!

01:01:26.355 --> 01:01:28.256
You're after that one, aren't you?

01:01:28.256 --> 01:01:29.569
The gold bar's the catch.

01:01:29.569 --> 01:01:32.089
Quite the materialist.

01:01:32.089 --> 01:01:34.314
Step aside, let me give it a shot.

01:01:34.314 --> 01:01:37.191
It's not just random button-mashing.

01:01:37.191 --> 01:01:39.456
There's real technique to it.

01:02:01.717 --> 01:02:03.208
So this...

01:02:04.173 --> 01:02:05.693
Grab...

01:02:05.693 --> 01:02:07.401
this one...

01:02:11.634 --> 01:02:13.282
Right this moment!

01:02:14.425 --> 01:02:16.522
That one won't come out.

01:02:16.522 --> 01:02:18.104
Looking at this machine,

01:02:18.104 --> 01:02:21.583
the claw's grip only holds
for about three seconds.

01:02:21.583 --> 01:02:23.401
And that doll's holding a metal bar,

01:02:23.401 --> 01:02:25.836
so the weight's beyond what it can lift.

01:02:26.696 --> 01:02:30.828
A thousand tries, ten thousand tries, no luck.

01:02:31.787 --> 01:02:33.953
It's not about your luck or your skill.

01:02:33.953 --> 01:02:35.715
It's just that.

01:02:36.314 --> 01:02:39.337
The thing's programmed that way.

01:02:39.337 --> 01:02:41.276
Some things won't happen.

01:02:42.133 --> 01:02:44.351
Not in a million years.

01:02:51.342 --> 01:02:53.572
That's my answer to you.

01:02:54.560 --> 01:02:56.366
For me,

01:02:59.983 --> 01:03:01.858
you and I won't work.

01:03:01.858 --> 01:03:04.291
That's just how I'm wired.

01:03:05.758 --> 01:03:09.451
For one, you report to me,

01:03:09.451 --> 01:03:12.633
and that alone is a wall I can't cross.

01:03:15.342 --> 01:03:17.088
And honestly,

01:03:18.122 --> 01:03:21.438
I think you've got your wires crossed.

01:03:21.438 --> 01:03:24.298
It's curiosity, pity, that kind of thing.

01:03:24.298 --> 01:03:25.878
Think about it.

01:03:25.878 --> 01:03:28.720
You learned way too much about me at once.

01:03:28.720 --> 01:03:32.053
You saw me naked, learned my family stuff.

01:03:32.053 --> 01:03:34.151
After seeing all that,

01:03:34.151 --> 01:03:35.826
you started thinking,

01:03:35.826 --> 01:03:38.750
I'm lonelier and sadder than I let on.

01:03:39.425 --> 01:03:41.479
That's what happened.

01:03:41.479 --> 01:03:44.235
Don't put labels on what I feel.

01:03:44.235 --> 01:03:46.583
Either way, that's where it started.

01:03:47.861 --> 01:03:49.709
Can you honestly deny that?

01:03:54.175 --> 01:03:56.108
What's wrong with that?

01:03:56.108 --> 01:03:58.183
Pity, curiosity, whatever.

01:03:58.183 --> 01:04:00.887
Liking someone is liking someone, isn't it?

01:04:00.887 --> 01:04:03.542
Feelings don't come labeled one and two,

01:04:03.542 --> 01:04:06.799
sorted clean like the periodic table.

01:04:06.799 --> 01:04:08.672
Wanting to hold you, wanting to see you,

01:04:08.672 --> 01:04:12.425
feeling sorry, worried, curious,

01:04:12.425 --> 01:04:14.528
even jealous,

01:04:16.841 --> 01:04:19.658
isn't all of that
what liking someone feels like?

01:04:26.854 --> 01:04:30.114
Feelings born from pity, I want no part of.

01:04:30.114 --> 01:04:32.627
Nothing's more pathetic.

01:04:33.509 --> 01:04:35.877
Or more clingy than that.

01:04:35.877 --> 01:04:39.136
If you can't accept it, that's not on me.

01:04:40.000 --> 01:04:42.160
What won't work...

01:04:43.415 --> 01:04:45.312
won't work.

01:05:09.703 --> 01:05:12.904
Wait, you two never fought, not even once?

01:05:12.904 --> 01:05:14.503
That's what I'm telling you.

01:05:14.503 --> 01:05:17.032
Honestly, I acted up plenty.

01:05:17.032 --> 01:05:18.909
My brother always let it slide.

01:05:18.909 --> 01:05:21.094
Glad you noticed.

01:05:23.676 --> 01:05:28.083
You thought he was cute though, right?

01:05:28.083 --> 01:05:30.145
He still is, to me.

01:05:31.755 --> 01:05:34.570
You really do like him.

01:05:36.744 --> 01:05:39.092
Of course, I like him.

01:05:39.092 --> 01:05:40.931
Are you hearing this?

01:05:40.931 --> 01:05:45.994
My brother goes silent
at moments like this, can't tell why.

01:05:52.800 --> 01:05:54.961
Come on.

01:06:22.300 --> 01:06:26.260
What won't work, won't work, ever.

01:06:26.260 --> 01:06:28.370
That's the answer I gave.

01:06:47.865 --> 01:06:50.225
Sorry about earlier today.

01:06:53.837 --> 01:06:56.719
You mean getting hit by your wife?

01:06:56.719 --> 01:06:59.106
A bigger paycheck will cover it.

01:07:03.717 --> 01:07:05.831
You doing okay?

01:07:05.831 --> 01:07:07.745
This much is nothing.

01:07:07.745 --> 01:07:11.371
I can take a hit pretty well, I'm fine.

01:07:19.185 --> 01:07:21.697
I thought you were looking at the ocean,

01:07:23.074 --> 01:07:25.007
turns out you were just staring at the dark.

01:07:28.668 --> 01:07:31.691
A pricey ocean view is useless at night.

01:07:31.691 --> 01:07:34.914
Where the sea ends and the sky begins,

01:07:35.512 --> 01:07:37.137
it's all just black.

01:07:38.018 --> 01:07:40.567
You can still feel it though.

01:07:41.384 --> 01:07:44.066
The sea breeze is blowing,

01:07:44.066 --> 01:07:45.978
and the waves are right there.

01:07:57.238 --> 01:07:58.699
I'll head in first.

01:07:58.699 --> 01:08:00.318
Get some rest.

01:08:00.318 --> 01:08:02.005
In Ah.

01:08:09.758 --> 01:08:11.556
Let go.

01:08:12.592 --> 01:08:14.351
Let go of me.

01:08:15.634 --> 01:08:16.958
I said let go.

01:08:16.958 --> 01:08:18.092
Hold on.

01:08:18.092 --> 01:08:19.298
Just a second.

01:08:19.298 --> 01:08:21.399
She told you to let go.

01:08:30.290 --> 01:08:31.893
Let her go.

01:08:40.782 --> 01:08:42.220
See?

01:08:43.910 --> 01:08:46.467
The thing you call impossible...

01:08:46.467 --> 01:08:48.802
it's not so impossible after all.

01:09:41.050 --> 01:09:42.965
The truth is, we go way back.

01:09:42.965 --> 01:09:44.002
It's all over now.

01:09:44.002 --> 01:09:47.261
I know you have feelings for Ms. Joo.

01:09:47.261 --> 01:09:49.300
Are these feelings
only on Vice Chairman's side?

01:09:49.300 --> 01:09:53.058
Or is something still alive between you two?

01:09:53.058 --> 01:09:54.883
Don't you have someone like that?

01:09:54.883 --> 01:09:57.271
Someone who'll back you no matter what.

01:09:57.271 --> 01:09:59.082
Acting tough is its own kind of sickness.

01:09:59.082 --> 01:10:01.882
Doing something crazy wouldn't kill you.

01:10:01.882 --> 01:10:04.198
Take all the time you need.

01:10:04.198 --> 01:10:06.947
Look deep into your own heart.

01:10:06.947 --> 01:10:09.037
I'll be right here waiting.
